# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     angle 5
# RESETIUS |     axiom C70\72[X]
# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS |     X=D/2[A]D/2[!A]D/2@0.618034X
# RESETIUS |     A=B
# RESETIUS |     B=E
# RESETIUS |     E=@0.381966>1X
# RESETIUS |   }
